{"sha": "c6f306d58ebe4a3fc487182b6923e34cab7fdc523e67e50cba4555aca5439764", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g11:reaction-energy} 章 --- 反应的能量：燃烧与键能}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:reaction-energy:1}", "木材燃烧：放热的。冰熔化：吸热的（它从", "外界吸收热量，尽管它不是化学反应）。冷敷袋：", "吸热的。暖手宝：放热的。阳光下制造糖：", "吸热的（能量来自光）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:reaction-energy:2}", "$Q = 3.0 \\times 890.7 = \\qty{2.7e3}{kJ}$，约 \\qty{2.7}{MJ}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:reaction-energy:3}", "反应物。它们的能量差主要以", "热量形式释放到外界。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:reaction-energy:4}", "$n = 100 / 46.0 = \\qty{2.17}{mol}$；$Q = 2.17 \\times 1367.6 =", "\\qty{2.97e3}{kJ}$，约 \\qty{3.0}{MJ}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:reaction-energy:5}", "断开 1 摩尔这类键所需的能量（分子和原子", "均为气态）。共用电子对将两个原子维系在一起，将它们", "拉开需要克服这种吸引作用，因此需要能量。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:reaction-energy:6}", "断键：$2 \\times 436 + 498 = \\qty{1370}{kJ}$；成键：", "$4 \\times 464 = \\qty{1856}{kJ}$；$E_r \\approx 1370 - 1856 =", "\\qty{-486}{kJ}$，放热的。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:reaction-energy:7}", "乙醇 \\ce{CH3-CH2-O-H} 含有 5 个 \\ce{C-H}、1 个 \\ce{C-C}、1 个 \\ce{C-O} 和 1", "个 \\ce{O-H}。断键：$5 \\times 415 + 345 + 350 + 464 + 3 \\times 498 =", "\\qty{4728}{kJ}$。成键：$4 \\times 741 + 6 \\times 464 = \\qty{5748}{kJ}$。", "$E_r \\approx \\qty{-1020}{kJ}$，比", "实测值 \\qty{1367.6}{kJ} 的绝对值小约四分之一。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:reaction-energy:8}", "丙烷：$2219.2 / 0.0440 = \\qty{5.04e4}{kJ/kg} = \\qty{50.4}{MJ/kg}$。", "甲烷：$890.7 / 0.0160 = \\qty{55.7}{MJ/kg}$。两者均与图中所示一致。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:reaction-energy:9}", "$Q = 1500 \\times 4.18 \\times 85 = \\qty{5.33e5}{J} = \\qty{533}{kJ}$；", "$n = 533 / 890.7 = \\qty{0.598}{mol}$，即 $0.598 \\times 16.0 =", "\\qty{9.6}{g}$ 的甲烷；若一半能量损失，则需 \\qty{19}{g}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:reaction-energy:10}", "氢气 > 甲烷 > 丙烷 > 辛烷 > 乙醇。", "$48.0 / 142.9 = \\qty{0.34}{kg}$ 的氢气。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:reaction-energy:11}", "断键：$946 + 3 \\times 436 = \\qty{2254}{kJ}$；成键：", "$6 \\times 390 = \\qty{2340}{kJ}$；$E_r \\approx \\qty{-86}{kJ}$，略", "放热。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:reaction-energy:12}", "水：$250 \\times 4.18 \\times 20 = \\qty{2.09e4}{J} = \\qty{20.9}{kJ}$。", "乙醇：$1.20 / 46.0 = \\qty{0.0261}{mol}$，可释放", "$0.0261 \\times 1367.6 = \\qty{35.7}{kJ}$。效率", "$20.9 / 35.7 \\approx \\qty{59}{\\percent}$。损失包括：热量被", "空气带走，热量使金属罐和支架升温，燃烧不完全（产生炭黑），", "以及部分乙醇未燃烧即挥发。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:reaction-energy:13}", "\\ce{2C8H18 + 25O2 -> 16CO2 + 18H2O}：生成 8 摩尔二氧化碳，", "质量为 \\qty{352}{g}，对应 \\qty{5470}{kJ}，故 $352 / 5.470 = \\qty{64.4}{g}$ 每", "兆焦。\\ce{C3H8 + 5O2 -> 3CO2 + 4H2O}：\\qty{132}{g} 对应", "\\qty{2219.2}{kJ}，故每兆焦为 \\qty{59.5}{g}。甲烷", "每兆焦仅 \\qty{49.4}{g}，释放的二氧化碳最少。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:reaction-energy:14}", "表中给出的是平均键能，而二氧化碳中的 \\ce{C=O} 键", "比平均值更强；实测值针对的是", "液态水，其液化释放的能量比气态", "反应更多；并且该方法将每个键视为独立于其", "相邻键。这一估算仍然有用：它给出了正确的符号", "（放热）和正确的数量级，无需任何测量。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:reaction-energy:15}", "断键：$4 \\times 464 = \\qty{1856}{kJ}$；成键：$2 \\times 436 + 498 =", "\\qty{1370}{kJ}$；$E_r \\approx \\qty{+486}{kJ}$，吸热，因此需要", "提供能量。之后燃烧氢气可将这部分能量重新释放出来：", "氢气储存的是在别处产生的能量，它本身并不产生能量。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:g11:reaction-energy:1}", "\\textbf{1.} \\ce{CH4 + 2O2 -> CO2 + 2H2O}。", "", "\\textbf{2.} \\ce{C2H6O + 3O2 -> 2CO2 + 3H2O}。", "", "\\textbf{3.} \\ce{2C8H18 + 25O2 -> 16CO2 + 18H2O}。", "", "\\textbf{4.} \\ce{2H2 + O2 -> 2H2O}。", "", "\\textbf{5.} 氢气。", "", "\\textbf{6.} \\qty{16.0}{g/mol}、\\qty{46.0}{g/mol}、\\qty{114.0}{g/mol}、", "\\qty{2.0}{g/mol}。", ""]}